<rml>
<head>
	<!--
		The editor's bar (I4b step 3; ADR-0015 §4): while a room is edited, a band at the bottom of the view names the
		room, what the reticle rests on (a game, pinned or not; an empty slot) or the game in the hand, the pending
		changes, the last refusal's reason, and the actions with the glyphs of the device used last (the pad's buttons, or
		the keys); with the menu (Start, Enter) a small panel above it: Salva, Annulla ultima azione, Esci senza salvare,
		Continua. Bound to the data model "edit_bar" of rv::app::EditBarPanel (src/app/src/edit_bar_panel.cpp), which
		also names the ids below: keep them in step (src/app/include/rv/app/edit_bar_ui.hpp,
		tests/unit/app/test_edit_bar_document.cpp).
		mode: preparing, browse, holding, busy, menu, saving, moving (I4b step 4: a piece of furniture held). target: ''
		(nothing), game, slot (an empty slot), dressed (an empty slot with decoration), fixture (a piece of furniture:
		fixtureKind shelf, cabinet, wall-shelf, display-case, showcase, sideboard, tv, poster, floor-lamp, table-lamp, rug,
		plant, sofa, armchair, desk, stool, beanbag, chair, furniture, by what it is drawn as; fixtureHung: on a wall;
		fixtureLocked: it cannot move, refusal names why at once). Moving: placeMoved (it stands elsewhere than where it
		was taken), verdict checking, ok, refused (refusal names the rule). device: pad, keys.
		refusal: an edit rule's or a validation rule's name ('' none);
		refusalKnown: the rules worded below, another rule reads in general. Every string is written here (CLAUDE.md):
		the panel binds titles, counts and keys. It takes no input: the world reads the editor's actions and passes the
		menu's focus.
	-->
	<title>Modifica stanza</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="edit_bar.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="edit_bar">
	<!-- The menu (Start, Enter), above the bar. -->
	<div id="edit-menu" data-if="mode == 'menu'">
		<h2>Modifiche alla stanza</h2>
		<p class="menu-note" data-if="pending == 0">Nessuna modifica da salvare.</p>
		<p class="menu-note" data-if="pending == 1">1 modifica non ancora salvata.</p>
		<p class="menu-note" data-if="pending > 1">{{ pending }} modifiche non ancora salvate.</p>
		<div id="edit-save" class="menu-button primary" data-class-focused="menuFocus == 'save'">Salva</div>
		<div id="edit-undo" class="menu-button" data-class-focused="menuFocus == 'undo'" data-class-off="pending == 0">Annulla ultima azione</div>
		<div id="edit-discard" class="menu-button" data-class-focused="menuFocus == 'discard'">Esci senza salvare</div>
		<div id="edit-continue" class="menu-button" data-class-focused="menuFocus == 'continue'">Continua</div>
	</div>

	<div id="edit-bar">
		<div class="bar-header">
			<span class="mark"><span class="shelf"></span><span class="shelf"></span><span class="shelf"></span></span>
			<p class="bar-title" data-if="roomKind == 'console' && roomNumber == 1">Modifica stanza · {{ roomTitle }}</p>
			<p class="bar-title" data-if="roomKind == 'console' && roomNumber > 1">Modifica stanza · {{ roomTitle }} {{ roomNumber }}</p>
			<p class="bar-title" data-if="roomKind == 'shared' && roomNumber == 1">Modifica stanza · Sala condivisa</p>
			<p class="bar-title" data-if="roomKind == 'shared' && roomNumber > 1">Modifica stanza · Sala condivisa {{ roomNumber }}</p>
			<p class="bar-title" data-if="roomKind == 'arcade' && roomNumber == 1">Modifica stanza · Sala giochi arcade</p>
			<p class="bar-title" data-if="roomKind == 'arcade' && roomNumber > 1">Modifica stanza · Sala giochi arcade {{ roomNumber }}</p>
			<span class="pending" data-if="pending == 0">Nessuna modifica</span>
			<span class="pending changed" data-if="pending == 1">1 modifica</span>
			<span class="pending changed" data-if="pending > 1">{{ pending }} modifiche</span>
		</div>

		<!-- What the reticle rests on, or the game in the hand. -->
		<div class="selection">
			<p data-if="mode == 'preparing'" class="quiet">Preparazione della stanza...</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'busy'" class="quiet">Sistemazione in corso...</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'saving' && ending == 'save'" class="quiet">Salvataggio delle modifiche...</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'saving' && ending == 'discard'" class="quiet">La stanza torna com'era...</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'menu'" class="quiet">Scegli cosa fare delle modifiche.</p>

			<p data-if="mode == 'browse' && target == ''" class="quiet">Punta un gioco o un arredo per prenderlo e spostarlo.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'browse' && target == 'fixture'"><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'shelf'">Scaffale</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'cabinet'">Cabinato</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'wall-shelf'">Mensola</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'display-case'">Vetrina</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'showcase'">Teca</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'sideboard'">Credenza</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'tv'">Televisore</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'poster'">Poster</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'floor-lamp'">Lampada a stelo</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'table-lamp'">Lampada da tavolo</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'rug'">Tappeto</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'plant'">Pianta</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'sofa'">Divano</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'armchair'">Poltrona</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'desk'">Scrivania</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'stool'">Sgabello</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'beanbag'">Pouf</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'chair'">Sedia</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'furniture'">Arredo</span><span class="tag pinned" data-if="targetPinned">Fissato</span><span class="quiet" data-if="!fixtureLocked && !fixtureHung"> · si può spostare e ruotare.</span><span class="quiet" data-if="!fixtureLocked && fixtureHung"> · scorre lungo le pareti.</span></p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'browse' && target == 'game'"><span class="title">{{ targetTitle }}</span><span class="tag pinned" data-if="targetPinned">Fissato</span><span class="tag" data-if="targetFaceOut">In vetrina</span></p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'browse' && targetFree" class="quiet">Spazio libero: prendi un gioco per posarlo qui.</p>

			<p data-if="mode == 'holding'"><span class="label">In mano:</span><span class="title">{{ heldTitle }}</span></p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'holding' && target == ''" class="quiet">Punta uno spazio libero o un altro gioco.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'holding' && targetOwn" class="quiet">Il suo posto: rimettilo qui.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'holding' && !targetOwn && target == 'slot' && targetFaceOut" class="aim">Posalo qui, in vetrina.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'holding' && !targetOwn && target == 'slot' && !targetFaceOut" class="aim">Posalo qui, sullo scaffale.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'holding' && !targetOwn && target == 'dressed'" class="aim">Posalo qui: la decorazione fa spazio.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'holding' && !targetOwn && target == 'game'" class="aim">Scambialo con {{ targetTitle }}<span class="tag pinned" data-if="targetPinned">Fissato</span></p>

			<p data-if="mode == 'moving'"><span class="label">Stai spostando:</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'shelf'">uno scaffale</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'cabinet'">un cabinato</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'wall-shelf'">una mensola</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'display-case'">una vetrina</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'showcase'">una teca</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'sideboard'">una credenza</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'tv'">un televisore</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'poster'">un poster</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'floor-lamp'">una lampada a stelo</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'table-lamp'">una lampada da tavolo</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'rug'">un tappeto</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'plant'">una pianta</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'sofa'">un divano</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'armchair'">una poltrona</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'desk'">una scrivania</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'stool'">uno sgabello</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'beanbag'">un pouf</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'chair'">una sedia</span><span class="title" data-if="fixtureKind == 'furniture'">un arredo</span></p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'moving' && !placeMoved" class="quiet">Al posto di prima: qui non cambia nulla.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'moving' && placeMoved && verdict == 'checking'" class="quiet">Verifica del posto...</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'moving' && placeMoved && verdict == 'ok'" class="aim">Si può posare qui.</p>
			<p data-if="mode == 'moving' && placeMoved && verdict == 'refused'" class="quiet">Qui non si può posare.</p>
		</div>

		<!-- The last refusal: why the change was not made (nothing changed). -->
		<div class="verdict" data-if="refusal != ''">
			<p data-if="saveRefused">Il mondo è cambiato nel frattempo e le modifiche non si possono più applicare: niente è stato salvato.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'slot-taken'">Quello spazio è già occupato.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'slot-pinned'">Quello spazio è riservato a un gioco fissato.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'other-room'">I giochi si spostano solo all'interno della loro stanza.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'same-game'">È lo stesso gioco.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'game-unknown'">Il gioco non è più nella stanza.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'slot-unknown'">Quello spazio non c'è più.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'pin-broken'">Un gioco o un arredo fissato non resterebbe al suo posto.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'failed'">La modifica non è riuscita: il registro di Retroverse dice perché.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'save-failed'">Le modifiche non sono state salvate: il registro di Retroverse dice perché.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'footprints-overlap'">Si sovrapporrebbe a un altro arredo.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'doorway-clearance'">Starebbe nello spazio da lasciare libero davanti alla porta.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'door-reserved'">Quel tratto di parete è riservato a una porta.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'fixture-outside-room'">Uscirebbe dalla stanza.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'unreachable'">Un mobile, una vetrina o la TV non si potrebbero più raggiungere: serve un passaggio libero largo 1,2 m.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'doorway-blocked'">Non lascerebbe spazio per entrare nella stanza.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'floor-unreachable'">Una stanza del piano non si potrebbe più raggiungere dall'ascensore.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'decoration-off-wall'">Una decorazione appesa deve restare su una parete.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'wall-mount'">Una decorazione appesa deve aderire a una parete, rivolta verso la stanza.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'off-grid'">Si sposta solo a passi di 10 cm sulla griglia della stanza.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'turn-step'">Ruota solo di un quarto di giro alla volta (le decorazioni di 15 gradi).</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'fixture-fixed'">Questo arredo resta al suo posto: si spostano solo i mobili delle pareti laterali, le vetrine e le decorazioni.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'fixture-in-kept-room'">La stanza segue un modello precedente: i suoi arredi si potranno spostare dopo «Rigenera stanza».</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'fixture-unknown'">Questo arredo non è più nella stanza.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'lights-over-limit'">La stanza avrebbe troppe luci.</p>
			<p data-if="refusal == 'fixture-on-walker'">Ci sei tu: fatti da parte e posalo.</p>
			<p data-if="!refusalKnown">La modifica non rispetta le regole della stanza.</p>
		</div>

		<!-- The actions, with the glyphs of the device used last. -->
		<div class="hints" data-if="mode == 'browse' || mode == 'holding'">
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'browse' && target != '' && target != 'slot' && target != 'dressed' && !fixtureLocked"><span class="key pad-a" data-if="device == 'pad'">A</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">E</span>Prendi</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'browse' && target != '' && target != 'slot' && target != 'dressed' && !fixtureLocked && !targetPinned"><span class="key pad-x" data-if="device == 'pad'">X</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">P</span>Fissa</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'browse' && target != '' && target != 'slot' && target != 'dressed' && !fixtureLocked && targetPinned"><span class="key pad-x" data-if="device == 'pad'">X</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">P</span>Sblocca</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'holding' && targetOwn"><span class="key pad-a" data-if="device == 'pad'">A</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">E</span>Rimetti</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'holding' && !targetOwn && targetFree"><span class="key pad-a" data-if="device == 'pad'">A</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">E</span>Posa</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'holding' && !targetOwn && target == 'game'"><span class="key pad-a" data-if="device == 'pad'">A</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">E</span>Scambia</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'pad'">Croce</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Frecce</span>Spazio vicino</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'holding'"><span class="key pad-b" data-if="device == 'pad'">B</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Esc</span>Rimetti a posto</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'browse' && pending == 0"><span class="key pad-b" data-if="device == 'pad'">B</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Esc</span>Esci</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'browse' && pending > 0"><span class="key pad-b" data-if="device == 'pad'">B</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Esc</span>Menu</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="mode == 'holding' || pending == 0"><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'pad'">Start</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Invio</span>Menu</span>
		</div>
		<div class="hints" data-if="mode == 'moving'">
			<span class="hint" data-if="placeMoved"><span class="key pad-a" data-if="device == 'pad'">A</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">E</span>Posa</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="!placeMoved"><span class="key pad-a" data-if="device == 'pad'">A</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">E</span>Rimetti</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="!fixtureHung"><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'pad'">LB RB</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Q R</span>Ruota</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'pad'">Croce</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Frecce</span>Sposta di 10 cm</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="key pad-b" data-if="device == 'pad'">B</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Esc</span>Rimetti a posto</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'pad'">Start</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Invio</span>Menu</span>
		</div>
		<div class="hints" data-if="mode == 'menu'">
			<span class="hint"><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'pad'">Croce</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Frecce</span>Scegli</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="key pad-a" data-if="device == 'pad'">A</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Invio</span>Conferma</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="key pad-b" data-if="device == 'pad'">B</span><span class="key wide" data-if="device == 'keys'">Esc</span>Continua</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
